## Common Issues & Solutions

| Issue                                                  | Solution                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| ------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Assets (images, data files) not loading                | All web assets must be placed inside the `web/` directory (e.g., `web/assets/data.json`). The Jaspr build process makes them available at the root (e.g., access via `/assets/data.json`).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| `@css` on private `_State` class                       | When converting a `StatelessComponent` to a `StatefulComponent`, move the `static @css get styles` getter from the private `_State` class to the public `StatefulComponent` class itself. The build system cannot access annotations on private members.                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| Unsupported CSS properties                             | For properties not exposed by the type-safe API (e.g., `animation`, `border-top`), use the `raw` map within `.styles()`. Ex: `raw: const {'animation': 'spin 1s linear'}`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| **@client component frame scheduling error**           | **Server-side `notifyListeners()` calls cause "Scheduling a frame is not supported on the server" errors. Wrap `notifyListeners()` in `if (kIsWeb)` check to prevent server-side execution.**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| **@client component state sharing**                    | **Use global state container pattern with `InheritedComponent` to share `ChangeNotifier` services across client component trees. Create global singleton and inject via `InheritedComponent` at root of each `@client` component.**                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
| **@client component server/client rendering mismatch** | **Use conditional rendering: `ListenableBuilder` only on client (`kIsWeb`), direct rendering on server. Extract shared content method to avoid duplication.**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| **CSS absolute positioning z-index stacking issues**   | **Remove problematic overlay elements or adjust z-index values. Grain/texture overlays with absolute positioning can interfere with content interaction.**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| Hot reload not working                                 | Check syntax errors, restart `jaspr serve`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| CSS not loading                                        | Verify `@css` syntax, run `jaspr clean`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| Build failures                                         | Check Dart SDK >=3.0, run `dart pub get`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| Color.hex() deprecated                                 | Use `Color(0xFF...)` constructor                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| Position API errors                                    | Use `.absolute(top: 0.px)` with parameters                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| Grid layout issues                                     | Use `GridTemplate` with `GridTracks`                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| **CSS properties not available in type-safe API**      | **Use the `raw` map within `.styles()` for unsupported properties. Examples: `.styles(raw: const {'text-transform': 'uppercase', 'aspect-ratio': '16/9', 'filter': 'grayscale(100%)', 'object-fit': 'cover', 'animation': 'spin 1s linear', 'backdrop-filter': 'blur(10px)', '-webkit-line-clamp': '3', 'clip-path': 'circle(50%)'})`. This covers animations, filters, transforms, webkit properties, and modern CSS features not yet in the type-safe API.** |
| **ZIndex requires ZIndex wrapper**                     | **Use `zIndex: const ZIndex(2)` instead of `zIndex: 2`. The zIndex property requires a ZIndex wrapper object.**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| **LineHeight requires Unit wrapper**                   | **Use `lineHeight: 1.3.px` instead of `lineHeight: 1.3`. LineHeight values need proper unit extensions.**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| **Margin.auto not available**                          | **Use explicit margin values like `margin: Margin.only(top: 16.px)` instead of `marginTop: Margin.auto`. Auto margins are not supported.**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |

## Performance Best Practices

- Use `const` constructors everywhere possible
- Implement semantic HTML for accessibility
- Optimize images and assets
- Leverage server-side rendering for SEO
- Use proper loading states and error boundaries
- Minimize client-side JavaScript

